      "caption_sha256": "351028b8a0657fa45cbbd051ffb1df44cc3f76ac89e170501f08a44d7f58e948",
      "caption_text": "Lord Rama got introduced to Sugreeva by Hanuman, who agrees to help Rama, if he helps him win against Vali. Rama flung the body of Asura Dhundubi with his toe  and pierced row of seven shala trees with one arrow, to prove his might to Sugreeva. He then killed mighty Vali, standing behind the tree. Rama stayed in the Matanga Muni ashrama during the entire rainy season tormented by the separation of wife Seetha.",
