      "caption_sha256": "351028b8a0657fa45cbbd051ffb1df44cc3f76ac89e170501f08a44d7f58e948",
      "caption_text": "Sampaathi grew its wings and flew higher and faster and found Seetha in Lanka with its long and distant vision. Hanuman leaped across the ocean and located her in Ashokavana, gave the ring and took choodamani in return. Hamuman met Ravana and agitated with the insult made by him, set fire and burned Lanka. Hanuman returned to ashrama quickly and gave information about Seetha and her choodamani to Rama.",
