      "caption_sha256": "351028b8a0657fa45cbbd051ffb1df44cc3f76ac89e170501f08a44d7f58e948",
      "caption_text": "Soon Monkeys built a bridge across the ocean with mountains, stones and logs.  Reaching Lanka, Monkeys attacked rakshashas with teeth, claws and mountains but sooner Indrajit, son of Ravana tied Rama and Lakshmana with Nagasthra. Garuda came flapping his wings immediately, releasing both of them.",
