    {
      "sloka": 7,
      "caption_anchor": "intake/D035/photo-captions.txt#019",
      "caption_sha256": "351028b8a0657fa45cbbd051ffb1df44cc3f76ac89e170501f08a44d7f58e948",
      "caption_text": "Rama fought with Ravana and killed him by cutting off his row of heads by Brahmasthra. Rama accepted Seetha Maatha after she was purified by fire God and returned to Ayodya in a Pushpaka Vimanam along with Vibheeshana, Hanuman and army of monkeys.",
