    {
      "sloka": 8,
      "caption_anchor": "intake/D035/photo-captions.txt#023",
      "caption_sha256": "351028b8a0657fa45cbbd051ffb1df44cc3f76ac89e170501f08a44d7f58e948",
      "caption_text": "Sage Vashishtar conducted Pattabhishekam for Rama and Seetha couple and Rama ruled the kingdom for more than 11,000 years. Rama sent Seetha Maa to exile. Seetha lived in Valmiki ashrama and gave birth to twin sons Luva and Kusha.",
