    {
      "sloka": 9,
      "caption_anchor": "intake/D035/photo-captions.txt#025",
      "caption_sha256": "351028b8a0657fa45cbbd051ffb1df44cc3f76ac89e170501f08a44d7f58e948",
      "caption_text": "Sage Valmiki attended Rama’s Ashwamedha Yagam with Luva and Kusha and made them render Ramayana sweetly. Rama want to take back Seetha, but Seetha Maa called her Mother Divine Earth and entered Earth. Rama rested the responsibility of Kingdom with his sons and sacrificed Lakshmana and departed the earth by submerging in to river Sarayu and reached Vaikunta.",
